[Trigger]
Name	openingRound
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	An old crew once rolled stone balls down these galleries to test their aim, and the course still stands. Four balls wait at the tees; roll each of them into its cup before the shift bell.
Action	objective	1	Roll all four boulders into their cups with the slaps you have.
Action	slaplimit	80
Action	timelimit	600
Action	reveal	1	LaneA
Action	reveal	1	LaneB
Action	reveal	1	LaneC
Action	reveal	1	LaneD
Action	golfball	1	22	12
Action	golfball	1	22	34
Action	golfball	1	27	23
Action	golfball	1	9	36
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cupA
Mode	once
Cond	boulder	CupA	>=	1
Action	message	1	A boulder dropped into cup A.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cupB
Mode	once
Cond	boulder	CupB	>=	1
Action	message	1	A boulder dropped into cup B.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cupC
Mode	once
Cond	boulder	CupC	>=	1
Action	message	1	A boulder dropped into cup C.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cupD
Mode	once
Cond	boulder	CupD	>=	1
Action	message	1	A boulder dropped into cup D.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	courseDone
Mode	once
Cond	boulder	CupA	>=	1
Cond	boulder	CupB	>=	1
Cond	boulder	CupC	>=	1
Cond	boulder	CupD	>=	1
Action	message	1	All four boulders lie in their cups. The old course is cleared and the heart answers with a shard.
Action	win	1
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
